            "description" : "Applications for preapprovals for Additional Dwelling Units (ADUs) received by the Department of Housing pursuant to the December 2020 ADU Ordinance. After issuance of an ADU preapproval, the owner must obtain a building permit from the Department of Buildings before constructing an ADU.\n\nDue to changes in the underlying data, the previous version of <a href=\"https://data.cityofchicago.org/Buildings/Additional-Dwelling-Unit-Preapproval-Applications-/xbwc-ntpx/about_data\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ADU Preapproval Applications Dataset</a> is being retired. The historical dataset is still available for viewing but will no longer be updated. \n\nFor a map of the eligible areas, please see https://data.cityofchicago.org/Buildings/Additional-Dwelling-Unit-Areas-Map/n8dk-kjjn\n\nFor more information about ADUs in Chicago, visit http://www.chicago.gov/ADU.",
